#: admin/views/tree_merge.php:324
msgid "Merge Options"
msgstr "Opzions di Union"

#: admin/views/tree_merge.php:328
msgid ""
"<b>NOTE:</b> None of these buttons will cause immediate merging. You will first be presented with information and can then decide to make a merge.<br><br>\n"
"<b>TIP:</b> Start with automatic merge to get rid of all obvious merges. (If no automatic merge options are found, try the duplicate merge option).<br>\n"
"These will likely cause surrounding relatives to be found, so continue with the \"Relatives merge\" option.<br>\n"
"Once you finish that, most needed merges will have been performed. You can then use \"Duplicate merge\" to see if there are duplicates left to consider for merging.<br>\n"
"As a last resort you can perform manual merges."
msgstr ""
"<b>NOTE:</b> Nissun di chestis sieltis a provoche une fusion imediade. Prin a ti ven presentadea cu lis informazions e si pues poi decidi se fâ la fusion. <br>\n"
"<b>SUGJERIMENT:</ b> Comence cu la fusion automatiche par gjavà vie dutis lis unions evidentsi (se no si cjate nissune opzion automatiche di union, prove cu l'opzion di Union Duplicâts).<br>\n"
"Al è probabil che chescj ti fasaran cjatâ Familiârs atôr, t u puedis daspò continuâ cu l'opzion \\ \"Union Familiârs \". <br>\n"
"Une volte finît, a saran stadis fatis li fusions plui necessaris. Tu puedis ancje utilizaâ \"Union Duplicâts \" par controlâ se a son presints duplicâts di podei unificâ.<br>\n"
"A si pues in ogni câs eseguî Fusions manuâl."

#: admin/views/tree_merge.php:339 admin/views/tree_merge_settings.php:78
msgid "Automatic merge"
msgstr "Union automatiche"

#: admin/views/tree_merge.php:343
msgid "You will be shown the set of strict criteria used for automatic merging and then you can decide whether to continue."
msgstr "Ti ven mostrât la liste di criteris rigorôs utilizâts pa la fusiòn automatiche e dopo si pò decidi se continuâ."

#: admin/views/tree_merge.php:359
msgid ""
"This button will become available if you have made merges, and surrounding relatives (parents, children or spouses) have to be considered for merging too.<br>\n"
"By pressing this button, you can then continue to check the surrounding relatives, pair by pair, and merge them if necessary. If those merges will create additional surrounding relatives to consider, they will be automatically added to the list.<br>\n"
"Surrounding relatives are saved to the database and you can also return to it at a later stage."
msgstr ""
"Chest boton al sarà ativât se a son stadis fatis unions, e i Familiârs dulintor (gjenitôrs, fîs o partner) a jan di jessi controlâts.<br>\n"
"Clicant achì, si pues continuâ a controlâ i Familiârs ator, copie par copia, e unî, s'al covente. Se chestis unions a incuintrin altri Familiârs atôr di cjapâ in considerazion, a saran automaticamentri zontâs ta liste.<br>\n"
"La liste di chescj familiârs di controlâ a ven salvade tal database e si pues ancje tornâ a viodile in tukl secont moment."

#: admin/views/tree_merge.php:372
msgid ""
"You will be presented, one after the other, with pairs of possible duplicates to consider for merging.<br>\n"
"After a merge you can switch to \"relatives merge\" and after that return to duplicate search where you left off."
msgstr ""
"A saran presentadis, une a la volte, lis copis di pusibils duplicâts di considerâ pa fusion.<br>\n"
"Dopo une union al è pussibil passâ a \"Unîs i Familiârs\" e podopo tornâ a continuâ la ricercje dei duplicâts."

#: admin/views/tree_merge.php:383
msgid "You can pick two persons out of the database to consider for merging."
msgstr "Tu puedis sielzi dos personis dal database par valutâ se uniu."

#: admin/views/tree_merge.php:392
msgid "Here you can change the default filters for the different merge options."
msgstr "Chi al è pusibil modificâ i filtris predefinits pas diferentis opzions union."

#: admin/views/tree_merge_automatic.php:13
msgid ""
"Automatic merge will go through the entire database and merge all persons who comply with ALL the following conditions:<br>\n"
"<ul><li>Both persons have a first name and a last name and they are identical</li>\n"
"<li>Both persons have parents with first and last names and those names are identical</li>\n"
"<li>Both persons' parents have a marriage date and it is identical (This can be disabled under \"Settings\")</li>\n"
"<li>Both persons have a birth date and it is identical OR both have a death date and it is identical</li></ul>\n"
"<b>Please note that the automatic merge may take quite some time, depending on the size of the database and the number of merges.</b><br>\n"
"You will be notified of results as the action is completed"
msgstr ""
"L'union automatiche a darà dâ une passade a dut il database e unssarà dutis lis personis che a sodifin DUTIS lis condizions sieltis: <br>\n"
"<ul> <li> Dutis dôs a jan di vei il non e il cognon identics </li>\n"
"<li>Dutia dôs a jan di vei gjenitôrs cun non e cognon identics </li>\n"
"<li> I gjenitôrs das dôs personis a jan di vei la date di matrimoni identiche (opzion c'àsi pues disabilitâ in \"Impostazions \") </li>\n"
"<li> Lis dôs personis a jan di vei la date di nassite identiche O PÛR la date di muart identiche </li> </ul>\n"
"<b> Ten presint che l'union automatichea pues richiedi un poc di timp, a secont das dimensions del database e al numar fusion. </b> <br>\n"
"Ti Une notifiche ti mostre i risultâs intant che la elaborazion a va indenant"

#: admin/views/tree_merge_automatic.php:25
msgid "Start automatic merge"
msgstr "A scomençe la unificazion automatiche"

#: admin/views/tree_merge_duplicate.php:8
msgid ""
"With \"Duplicate merge\" the program will look for all persons with a fixed set of criteria for identical data.\n"
"These are:\n"
"<ul><li>Same last name and same first name.<br>\n"
"By default, people with blank first or last names are included. You can disable that under \"Settings\" in the main menu.</li>\n"
"<li>Same birthdate or same deathdate.<br>\n"
"By default, when one or both persons have a missing birth/death date they will still be included when the name matches.\n"
"You can change that under \"Settings\" in the main menu.</li></ul>\n"
"The found duplicates will be presented to you, one pair after the other, with their details.<br>\n"
"You can then decide whether to accept the default merge, or change which details of the right person will be merged into the left.<br>\n"
"If you decide not to merge this pair, you can \"skip\" to the next pair.<br>\n"
"If after the merge there are surrounding relatives that might need merging too, you will be urged to move to \"Relatives merge\"<br>\n"
"If you have interrupted a duplicate merge in this session (for example to move to \"relatives merge\"),\n"
"this page will also show a \"Continue duplicate merge\" button so you can continue where you left off.<br>\n"
"<b>Please note that generating the duplicates may take some time, depending on the size of the tree.</b>"
msgstr ""
"Cun \"Union Duplicâts\" il programa al cirarà dutis lis personis cun dâts identics in base a un numar fis di criteris.\n"
"Chescj a son:\n"
"<ul><li>Stes cognon e stes non.<br>\n"
"Par impostazion predefinide, a son cjapadis dentri ancje lis personis cul non o il cognon in blanc. Tu puedis disativâ da \"Impostazions\" tal menu principâl.</li>\n"
"<li>Stesse date di nassite o stesse date di muart.<br>\n"
"Par impostazion predefinide, a son cjapadis dentri ancje lis personis cence la date di nassite/muart, se i nons a corispuindin\n"
"Si pues cambiâ cheste sielte in \"Impostazions\" tal menu principâl.</li></ul>\n"
"I duplicâts cjatâs a vegnin presentâs, une copie a la volte, cun ducj i dâts che a je riguarde.<br>\n"
"Al è duncje possibil decidi se acetâ l'union predefinide, o completâ i dâts da la persone di gjestre che a vignaran units a chê di sinistre.<br>\n"
"Se si decît di no unî cheste copie, si pues \"passâ\" a la prossime copie.<br>\n"
"Se dopo l'union a son altris Familiârs che puedis jessi unîs, si pues passâ a \" Union Familiârs\"<br> \n"
"Se tu interompis l'union dai duplicâts (par esempli, par passâ a \"Union Familiârs\"),\n"
"tu puedis clicâ su \"Continue union duplicâts \"  in mût di podei continuâ da lì cìa si veve interot.<br>\n"
"<b>La creazion das tabelis di duplicâts a pues vei dibisugne di timp, a secont da dimension dal Arbul.</b>"

