#: views/help.php:10
#, php-format
msgid "%s is a free, open-source and multilingual server-side program that makes it very easy to publish your genealogical data on the internet as a dynamic and searchable family tree website."
msgstr "%s al è un program bande-server gratuit, open source e multilengaç che al rint une vôre facil publicâ i toi dâts gjenealogjics in Internet, in tun sît web personâl, cun t'un o plui arbui gjenealogjics atualizabil e subite consultabil."

#: views/help.php:15
msgid "Icons"
msgstr "Iconis"

#: views/help.php:19
msgid "This icon is shown to the left of names of persons in lists or reports. When you hover over this icon with your mouse, a pop-up will be displayed. In the pop-up list you will find several icons with names of reports and charts that you can create from this person (the exact number of icons on the list varies according to the presence of ancestors and/or descendants). Following is a list of those icons and their meaning."
msgstr "Cheste icone a compâr a sinistre dai nons das personis tai elencos o tas schedis. Cun tun CLIC su cheste icone, al comparirà un barconut. E tal barconut tu cjatis tantis iconis cui nons dai reports e dai grafics che tu puedis creâ di cheste persone (il numar esat di iconis ta liste al varie a seconde da la presince di antenâts e/o dissendents). Plui sot a jè ripuartade une liste di chestis iconis e il lôr significât."

#: views/help.php:23
msgid "A pedigree is a genealogical report of a person's ancestors. A pedigree uses a special method of numbering: the base person is number 1, his father number 2 and his mother number 3. The number of a father is ways twice that of his son and the mother is one number higher. Thus, number 40 is the father of number 20 and 41 is the mother of number 20. <br>From amongst the icons in the pop-up menu you can also choose a graphical display of the ancestor report."
msgstr "Un pedigree al è il rapuart gjenealogjic dai antenâts di une persone. Un pedigree al utilize un sisteme speciâl di numerazion: la persone ultime nassude a jè il numar 1, il pâri numar 2 e so mâri numar 3. Il numar di un pâri al è il dopli di chel di so fî e la mâri a jè un numar in plui. Cussì, il numar 40 al è il pâri dal numar 20 e 41 a jè la mâri dal numar 20. ‎<br>‎Tra lis iconis da liste tu puedis ancje sielzi una visualizazion grafiche dal rapuart dai antenâts."

#: views/help.php:27
msgid "A descendant report is a genealogical report of a patriarchal couple or of one patriarch (generation I) with their children (generation II) and all further descendants, both along male and female lines. <br>From amongst the icons in the pop-up menu you can also choose a graphical display of the descendant report."
msgstr "Un rapuart dissendent al è la storie gjenealogjiche di une copie patriarcâl o di un patriarcje (generazion I) cui lôr fîs (generazion II) e ducj chei altris dissendents, seial pa linie maschîl che femminîl.<br>Tra lis iconis dal menu tu puedis ancje sielzi une visualizazion grafiche dal rapuart dissendent."

#: views/help.php:31
msgid "An outline report is a clear summary of all descendants of one person (and his/her partners), where each generation gets its own (ascending) number."
msgstr "‎Un rapuart struturât al è un clâr scheme di ducj i dissendents di une persone (e dai soi partner): a ogni gjenerazion al è assegnât un numar (cressint)."

#: views/help.php:35
msgid "An ancestor sheet lists 5 generations in table layout, with the base person at the bottom and the ancestors above him/her in increasingly smaller boxes."
msgstr "Une liste dai antenâts al elenche 5 gjenerazions in tune tabele, cu la persone di base in bas e i antenâts parsôre di lui in caselis simpri plui piçulis."

#: views/help.php:39
msgid "A fanchart is a circular chart that shows the ancestors in circles around the base person. This allows for a very clear view of the ancestry of any specific person. The box for each person on the chart is clickable to enable fast access to that person's family sheet. <br> The size of the fanchart and some other settings may be adjusted from the menu to the left of the chart."
msgstr "Un grafic a parefresc al è un grafic circolâr che al mostre i antenâts in cerclis intôr da persone di base. Chest al ofris une vision une vôre clare da assendence di ogni singule persone. Su la casele di ogni persone sul grafic a si pues clicâ par par un rapid acèsa la schede di famee di chê persone.<br>La dimension dal grafic a parefresc e qualchi altre impostazion a puedin jessi regoladis dal menu a sinistre dal grafic."

#: views/help.php:43
msgid "The timeline chart displays historic events alongside a person's life events to give a context of the time in which the person lived.<br>This chart has its own dedicated help which you can view by hovering the cursor over the word \"Help\" to the left of screen."
msgstr "La Cronologjie dai Events a mostre i Events stotics insiemi cui events da vite di une persone cussì di fornî il contest dal timp di vite di une persone<br>Chestis pagjinis a jan un aiût dedicât che a si pues viodi passand il cursôr su la peraule \"Aiût\" a sinistre dal schermi."

#: views/help.php:48
msgid "Top Ribbon"
msgstr "Sbare multifunzionâl in alt"

#: views/help.php:50
msgid "“Search” field and button"
msgstr "‎Cjamp e boton \"Cîr\"‎"

#: views/help.php:52
#, php-format
msgid "This box appears on all pages of %s and allows you the convenience to search for any persons from the database from any page. Typing in a name and clicking search will display a list of people from the database bearing a name matching the search term."
msgstr "Cheste casele a je presint in dutis lis pagjinis di %s e a permet di cirî dutis lis personis dal database da cualsisei pagjine. Digjitant un non e clicant su <b>Cîr</b>, al compâr un elenc di personis cul non corispondent."

#: views/help.php:55
msgid "The orange RSS-icon"
msgstr "‎L'icone-RSS naranç‎"

#: views/help.php:55
msgid "(only displayed if activated by the site owner and enabled in webbrowser)"
msgstr "‎(visualizzât dome se attivât dal proprietari dal sito e abilitât tal browser in rêt)‎"

#: views/help.php:56
msgid "If you add this feed (as it's called) to your RSS-reader, you will be able to see at one glance who has a birthday!<br>(In the \"Tools\" pull-down menu you may see an \"Anniversary List\" option. That option will display a list of birthdays in the present month)."
msgstr "‎Se zontis chest feed (come che lo clamin) al to RSS-reader  tu  as la pussibilitât di vodi a colp i compleans!‎<br>‎(Tal menu \"Strumenti\" a si pues clicâ su la opzion \"Elenc Aniversaris\". Cheste opzion a mostre un elenc dai compleans dal mês corint)."

#: views/help.php:62
msgid "Menu items"
msgstr "Vôs dal menu‎"

#: views/help.php:64 views/help.php:146 views/layout.php:574
msgid "Family tree index"
msgstr "Indiç dai Arbui Gjenealogjics"

#: views/help.php:65
msgid "This takes you to the main Persons Index. The \"Home\" page can be replaced by a custom page made by the website owner."
msgstr "Chest ti puarte al Indiç principâl das personis. La pagjine \"Home\" a pues sei sostituide da une pagjine personalizade fate dal proprietario del sito web."

#: views/help.php:69
msgid "Takes you to the main persons index. Same as the \"Home\" button. The list shows all persons in the family tree, sorted alphabetically. A maximum number of 150 persons is displayed. You can press the page numbers to see more. You can chose between \"Concise view\" or \"Expanded view\". In the expanded view (ex)partners are also displayed, that are not shown in concise view."
msgstr "Ti puarte all'indic principâl das personis. Come il boton \"Home\". La liste a mostre dutis lis personis dall'arbul in ordin alfabetic. A son mostradis al massim 150 personis par pagjine. Tu puedis sielzi la pagjne di viodi. Tu puedis sielzi tra \"Vedude strete\" o \"Vedude largje\". Ta vedude largje a son mostrâts ancje i (ex)partner che invesit no si viodin ta vedude strete."

#: views/help.php:73
msgid "Here you will find a list of all family names, followed by the number of persons who carry that name."
msgstr "Chi tu cjatis un elenco di dugj i cognons, cun dongje il numar di personis ccun chel cognon."

#: views/help.php:76 views/help.php:81 views/help.php:86
msgid "(only displayed if activated by the site owner)"
msgstr "‎(visualizât dome se ativât del aministratôr dal sît)‎"

#: views/help.php:77
msgid "Here you can search by place of birth, baptism, by address, place of death or burial. You can search with the options: \"contains\", \"equals\" and \"starts with\". Here too, you can choose between expanded or concise view. The results will be sorted alphabetically by place name."
msgstr "Chi al è pussibil cirî par lûdi nassire, di batisim, par indiriz, lûc di muart o sepulture. Si pues sielzi di cirî cun:  \"al conten\", \"compagn che\" e \"al començe cun\". Anje chi si po sielzi tra viste slargjade o strete. I risultâts a son presentâs in ordin alfabetic par non di lûc."

#: views/help.php:81 views/layout.php:593
msgid "Photobook"
